<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (2\) Goal setting: You should have  goals which are measurable so you can track progress more objectively. For example, if you want to lose fat, a related performance goal could be improving your 5k run time. A related habit goal could be only having 1 snack in between meals instead of 2. If you wish to improve the size of your pectoral \(chest\) muscles, a performance goal could be to improve the number of push ups you can perform, and a habit goal could be to have 3-4 servings of lean protein a day. Focus on performance and habit goals and your aesthetic goals will come as a by-product. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0 1 2]
>>
endobj
