286 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Fibre: Fibre contains 0 calories, and it is very filling.  THIS IS A DREAM when on a fat loss phase. You can feel full without adding significantly to your daily calorie target. Fibre supports digestion, bowel movements and lowering of LDL cholesterol. A good rule of thumb is that for every 1000 calories you consume, there should be at least 15g of fibre. In short, eat your fruit and veggies. Eat at least 5 portions of a wide range of fruit and vegetables per day. If your goal is to lose fat, without tracking calories, at meal times,  fill up half of your plate with a high fibre food \(e.g. lettuce, kale\). )
/E (Fibre: Fibre contains 0 calories, and it is very filling.  THIS IS A DREAM when on a fat loss phase. You can feel full without adding significantly to your daily calorie target. Fibre supports digestion, bowel movements and lowering of LDL cholesterol. A good rule of thumb is that for every 1000 calories you consume, there should be at least 15g of fibre. In short, eat your fruit and veggies. Eat at least 5 portions of a wide range of fruit and vegetables per day. If your goal is to lose fat, without tracking calories, at meal times,  fill up half of your plate with a high fibre food \(e.g. lettuce, kale\). )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
endobj
